Package: nhsrtt
Title: Who Waits Longest? England's NHS Waiting List in R
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("Qais", "Adeniji-Bello", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Cleans NHS England Referral to Treatment (RTT) waiting-time files, rebuilds the published figures,
    and analyses waits by specialty and trust with overdispersed funnel plots.
License: MIT
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: dplyr, tidyr, readr, readxl, stringr, ggplot2, scales, jsonlite, rmarkdown, knitr
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
